The '''Otolla''' were one of the two major [[Subspecies|races]] of the [[Gungan]] [[species]]. They were characterized by their tall and usually lanky bodies, longer [[haillu]]s, prominent bills, and inquisitive [[eye]]s that sat up on short stalks. The Otolla were a younger race than the bulkier [[Ankura]]. [[Jar Jar Binks]] was a typical Otolla.<ref name="USW" />

